    },
    "name": "Samuel"
  },
  "pauses": {
    "line_ms": 180,
    "verse_ms": 500
  },
  "duration": 193.134,
  "lines": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 19.133,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And then shall that which is written come to pass: Sing, O barren, thou that didst not bear; break forth into singing, and cry aloud, thou that didst not travail with child; for more are the children of the desolate than the children of the married wife,",
      "verse": "22:1",
      "lineIndex": 1
    },
    {
      "start": 19.313,
      "end": 20.613,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "saith the Lord.",
      "verse": "22:1",
      "lineIndex": 2
    },
    {
      "start": 21.293,
      "end": 32.578,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Enlarge the place of thy tent, and let them stretch forth the curtains of thy habitations; spare not, lengthen thy cords and strengthen thy stakes;",
      "verse": "22:2",
      "lineIndex": 3
    },
    {
      "start": 33.258,
      "end": 36.741,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For thou shalt break forth on the right hand and on the left,",
      "verse": "22:3",
      "lineIndex": 4
    },
    {
      "start": 36.921,
      "end": 42.912,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and thy seed shall inherit the Gentiles and make the desolate cities to be inhabited.",
      "verse": "22:3",
      "lineIndex": 5
    },
    {
      "start": 43.592,
      "end": 44.846,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Fear not,",
      "verse": "22:4",
      "lineIndex": 7
    },
    {
      "start": 45.026,
      "end": 46.976,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for thou shalt not be ashamed;",
      "verse": "22:4",
      "lineIndex": 8
    },
    {
      "start": 47.156,
      "end": 48.967,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "neither be thou confounded,",
      "verse": "22:4",
      "lineIndex": 9
    },
    {
      "start": 49.147,
      "end": 51.283,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for thou shalt not be put to shame;",
      "verse": "22:4",
      "lineIndex": 10
    },
    {
      "start": 51.463,
      "end": 54.342,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for thou shalt forget the shame of thy youth,",
      "verse": "22:4",
      "lineIndex": 11
    },
    {
      "start": 54.522,
      "end": 61.07,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and shalt not remember the reproach of thy youth, and shalt not remember the reproach of thy widowhood any more.",
      "verse": "22:4",
      "lineIndex": 12
    },
    {
      "start": 61.75,
      "end": 65.744,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For thy maker, thy husband, the Lord of Hosts is his name;",
      "verse": "22:5",
      "lineIndex": 13
    },
    {
      "start": 65.924,
      "end": 71.032,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and thy Redeemer, the Holy One of Israel\u2014the God of the whole earth shall he be called.",
      "verse": "22:5",
      "lineIndex": 14
    },
    {
      "start": 71.712,
      "end": 76.356,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For the Lord hath called thee as a woman forsaken and grieved in spirit,",
      "verse": "22:6",
      "lineIndex": 15
    },
    {
      "start": 76.536,
      "end": 78.161,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and a wife of youth,",
      "verse": "22:6",
      "lineIndex": 16
    },
    {
      "start": 78.341,
      "end": 80.106,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "when thou wast refused,",
      "verse": "22:6",
      "lineIndex": 17
    },
    {
      "start": 80.286,
      "end": 81.633,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "saith thy God.",
      "verse": "22:6",
      "lineIndex": 18
    },
    {
      "start": 82.313,
      "end": 84.867,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For a small moment have I forsaken thee,",
      "verse": "22:7",
      "lineIndex": 19
    },
    {
      "start": 85.047,
      "end": 87.555,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but with great mercies will I gather thee.",
      "verse": "22:7",
      "lineIndex": 20
    },
    {
      "start": 88.235,
      "end": 91.857,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "In a little wrath I hid my face from thee for a moment,",
      "verse": "22:8",
      "lineIndex": 21
    },
    {
      "start": 92.037,
      "end": 95.659,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but with everlasting kindness will I have mercy on thee,",
      "verse": "22:8",
      "lineIndex": 22
    },
    {
      "start": 95.839,
      "end": 97.65,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "saith the Lord thy Redeemer.",
      "verse": "22:8",
      "lineIndex": 23
    },
    {
      "start": 98.33,
      "end": 104.924,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For this, the waters of Noah unto me, for as I have sworn that the waters of Noah should no more go over the earth,",
      "verse": "22:9",
      "lineIndex": 24
    },
    {
      "start": 105.104,
      "end": 107.983,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "so have I sworn that I would not be wroth with thee.",
      "verse": "22:9",
      "lineIndex": 25
    },
    {
      "start": 108.663,
      "end": 111.357,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For the mountains shall depart",
      "verse": "22:10",
      "lineIndex": 26
    },
    {
      "start": 111.537,
      "end": 113.395,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the hills be removed,",
      "verse": "22:10",
      "lineIndex": 27
    },
    {
      "start": 113.575,
      "end": 116.083,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but my kindness shall not depart from thee,",
      "verse": "22:10",
      "lineIndex": 28
    },
    {
      "start": 116.263,
      "end": 119.514,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "neither shall the covenant of my peace be removed,",
      "verse": "22:10",
      "lineIndex": 29
    },
    {
      "start": 119.694,
      "end": 121.923,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "saith the Lord that hath mercy on thee.",
      "verse": "22:10",
      "lineIndex": 30
    },
    {
      "start": 122.603,
      "end": 126.365,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "O thou afflicted, tossed with tempest, and not comforted!",
      "verse": "22:11",
      "lineIndex": 32
    },
    {
      "start": 126.545,
      "end": 132.025,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, I will lay thy stones with fair colors, and lay thy foundations with sapphires.",
      "verse": "22:11",
      "lineIndex": 33
    },
    {
      "start": 132.705,
      "end": 138.696,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And I will make thy windows of agates, and thy gates of carbuncles, and all thy borders of pleasant stones.",
      "verse": "22:12",
      "lineIndex": 34
    },
    {
      "start": 139.376,
      "end": 142.348,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And all thy children shall be taught of the Lord;",
      "verse": "22:13",
      "lineIndex": 35
    },
    {
      "start": 142.528,
      "end": 145.268,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and great shall be the peace of thy children.",
      "verse": "22:13",
      "lineIndex": 36
    },
    {
      "start": 145.948,
      "end": 148.502,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "In righteousness shalt thou be established;",
      "verse": "22:14",
      "lineIndex": 37
    },
    {
      "start": 148.682,
      "end": 151.004,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "thou shalt be far from oppression",
      "verse": "22:14",
      "lineIndex": 38
    },
    {
      "start": 151.184,
      "end": 152.995,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for thou shalt not fear,",
      "verse": "22:14",
      "lineIndex": 39
    },
    {
      "start": 153.175,
      "end": 154.661,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and from terror",
      "verse": "22:14",
      "lineIndex": 40
    },
    {
      "start": 154.841,
      "end": 156.791,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for it shall not come near thee.",
      "verse": "22:14",
      "lineIndex": 41
    },
    {
      "start": 157.471,
      "end": 161.326,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, they shall surely gather together against thee, not by me;",
      "verse": "22:15",
      "lineIndex": 43
    },
    {
      "start": 161.506,
      "end": 166.196,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "whosoever shall gather together against thee shall fall for thy sake.",
      "verse": "22:15",
      "lineIndex": 44
    },
    {
      "start": 166.876,
      "end": 169.059,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, I have created the smith",
      "verse": "22:16",
      "lineIndex": 45
    },
    {
      "start": 169.239,
      "end": 171.515,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that bloweth the coals in the fire,",
      "verse": "22:16",
      "lineIndex": 46
    },
    {
      "start": 171.695,
      "end": 175.039,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and that bringeth forth an instrument for his work;",
      "verse": "22:16",
      "lineIndex": 47
    },
    {
      "start": 175.219,
      "end": 177.913,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I have created the waster to destroy.",
      "verse": "22:16",
      "lineIndex": 48
    },
    {
      "start": 178.593,
      "end": 181.565,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "No weapon that is formed against thee shall prosper;",
      "verse": "22:17",
      "lineIndex": 49
    },
    {
      "start": 181.745,
      "end": 186.435,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and every tongue that shall revile against thee in judgment thou shalt condemn.",
      "verse": "22:17",
      "lineIndex": 50
    },
    {
      "start": 186.615,
      "end": 190.98,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "This is the heritage of the servants of the Lord, and their righteousness is of me,",
      "verse": "22:17",
      "lineIndex": 51
    },
    {
      "start": 191.16,
      "end": 192.46,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "saith the Lord.",
      "verse": "22:17",
      "lineIndex": 52
    }
  ]
}